# Responsibility: Exempt machine-emitted CAD and mesh fixtures from the whitespace linter.
# Boundaries: one attribute per generated format, so `git diff --check` stays meaningful for hand-edited source.

# Generated CAD / mesh-surface fixtures are machine-emitted text (OpenCASCADE STEP, VTK XML).
# They carry format-inherent trailing whitespace and are opaque data, not hand-edited source -
# exempt them from the whitespace linter so `git diff --check` stays meaningful for real code.
*.step -whitespace
*.stp  -whitespace
*.vtp  -whitespace
*.stl  -whitespace
